Package: gorump
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, qemu-kvm, wget, git
Description: Go programming language with the Rumprun utilities for running on Rumprun.
 Both go and rumprun binaries are downloaded from AWS and installed 
 by debian package script. It replaces current Go version and 
 put Rumprun utilities to user home directory.
